tarted from that station."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Before I get into that, let me introduce my past self.."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["In the past, I was actually a shy otaku. Even though"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I wasn't disliked by girls in my class, due to my"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["introversion, I didn't really dare talk with them."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Compared to real life, 2D girls are more beautiful..."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["You don't need to worry about saying something wrong, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["and you don't have to fear getting disliked by others."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Although my friends poked fun at me, I still enjoyed"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["this kind of life, and was happy to continue living "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["like this..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["...."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[2,"88",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[2,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,500,false]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["As for what I thought of Nozomi-chan... Obviously, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["she's a beautiful girl in both personality and looks,"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["basically perfect. She has many admirers in her year "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["and even throughout the school."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Because of this, I knew we were on two different levels."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["After graduation, we may have drifted apart, and never"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["meet again."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But... Fate is unpredictable. On that day at the train "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["station, Nozomi-chan's and my life got "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["“intertwined”..."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[3,"86",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[3,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,120,true]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["When I was framed with no evidence and was about to"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["surrender, that girl stood up for me..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Even without reasons, even when I gave up, she still"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["firmly believed I was innocent."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Even when all the evidence pointed to me, she kept "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["defending me, using her thinking cap to let me free."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["All because.... She trusted me."]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[60]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[3,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,120,false]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Since then, I could never forget her standing up for me."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Her bravery, wisdom and determination touched me deeply."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I decided then that no matter what happens, I'd never"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["give up. Even if I didn't succeed, I'd try my best."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Determination doesn't guarantee success, but if I gave"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["up now, you'll definitely fail. That's what Nozomi "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["taught me."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[4,"89",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[4,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,500,false]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[60]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["After that, I did my best to repay Nozomi. Although"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["looking at and talking to beautiful girls made my heart"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["race, and even difficult to breathe, just for Nozomi, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I was willing to take the first step..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["However as I got to know her better, I discovered that"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["... Nozomi wasn't what my impression of her was,"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["as an optimistic, bubbly and perfect girl."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["She'd sometimes get sad and break down, and would even"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["hide in a corner and cry alone..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Although she always seemed very bubbly in front of "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["others, I still noticed that it was a façade to hide "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["her pain."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["...."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[5,"90",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[5,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,120,false]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I was deeply hurt when I saw Nozomi like this."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It turned out that the very girl who brought me light, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["was also in darkness..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I really wanted to help her, wipe her tears, and"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["support her, just as she did when she stood tall "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["in front of me..."]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[60]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["However, she never let her guard down or expressed her"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["feelings, even to her closest friends. We were just "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["regular classmates, nothing more...."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["After that, I decided to help her secretly."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["No matter what, no matter how difficult it'd be, I "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["didn't want to see this girl cry anymore..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I wiped the blackboard when she forgot to, gave her an"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["umbrella whenever she forgot to bring it, and even"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["bought all her burnt cookies at the charity sale..."]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[5,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,120,false]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But... she still discovered me a few times. After all,"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Nozomi was from the Detective Agency. She had a very"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["keen sense of smell and detective ability. Whenever "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["she did, I played dumb..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["During this time, I also wanted to try to get closer to "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["her and learn more about her..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But, I was still too timid and didn't go any further."]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[60]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[6,"87",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["These days kept coming..."]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[6,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,120,false]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Until that one day."]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[120]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[7,"巨研社",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[7,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,60,false]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["By chance, I stumbled across a club called the "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["“Giant Girl Club” and sneaked in."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Members of the club told me that Nozomi was a member "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["that recently joined."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[8,"91",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[8,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,60,false]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Just as I felt sorry for my sudden intrusion and wanted "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["to leave, Nozomi asked me to stay..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["She looked innocent as she hesitantly told me that she"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["wanted to play a “game” with me."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["From memory, Nozomi-chan rarely asked for anything, and "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["since this was the first time she asked me for anything, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I agreed straight away..."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[9,"93",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[9,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,60,false]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Following the instructions of the club members, I"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["entered a machine. I then woke in an unfamiliar hotel."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["In this strange hotel, Nozomi-chan's voice sounded like"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["it came from all directions, yet I couldn't see her. I"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["was very confused and followed her instructions to the "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["rooftop."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"92",0,0,0,-610,100,100,255,0]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[60]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,260,true]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["When I saw her again, she was like a goddess. Her"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["figure could easily overshadow buildings, and she "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["could cross entire blocks in just one step..."]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[1]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[2]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[3]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[4]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[5]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[6]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[7]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[8]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[9]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The classmate that I spent my days with was suddenly"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["as tall as the mountains. This difference in size "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["terrified me, leading to me subconciously running "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["away..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["And so, this game of Nozomi being the hunter, and me "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["as the prey begun."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"94",0,0,0,-450,100,100,255,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,60,true]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["During this game, I gradually experienced Nozomi's"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["cruelty, which was completely different to the gentle "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["and bubbly girl I remembered..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["She crushes buildings and cars indiscriminately, and"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["treats humans like ants, just like kaijus in movies..."]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,120,true]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Yet at the same time, I also noticed she had a smile I"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["had never seen before. Unlike her usual smile, this one"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["was of pure joy from the bottom of her heart."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["At that moment, I seemingly knew this girl's secret"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["and all the grievances she'd been suffering..."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[2,"95",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[2,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,120,true]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["When that game ended, she told me everything..."]},